<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SoundView starts Tekelec.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SoundView starts Tekelec.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group telecommunications analyst Kevin Slocum said on Wednesday he initiated coverage of Tekelec with short-term and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Earnings and (loss) per share estimates were:</p>
<p>- FY 96 $(0.27)</p>
<p>- FY 97 $0.69</p>
<p>- FY 98 $1.09</p>
<p>- FY 99 $1.61</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 13-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
